    ctx.consume();
  },

  // ── TICK: While carried ─────────────────────────────────────────
  // Each turn, if undead are nearby, the vessel pulses.
  // Drains stability. When stability hits 0, the vessel cracks.
  // While cracked, leaks radiance that damages nearby undead.
